2. Main Modules

1. User Interface Module
Provides a simple interface where users can enter their story idea and select options such as genre and story style.

2. Story Generation Module
Uses Gemini to expand the user's idea into a structured story with a beginning, middle, climax and ending.

3. Character Creation Module
Generates character names, personalities, roles and relationships based on the story.

4. Scene Generation Module
Divides the story into scenes and provides descriptions for each comic panel.

5. Dialogue Generation Module
Creates suitable conversations between characters according to the scene.

6. Editing Module
Allows users to edit, regenerate or modify the generated story and dialogues.

7. Comic Output Module
Combines the generated content into an organized comic-story format.

